  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working for Health MPTF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Working for Health MPTF is a strategic, multi-stakeholder pooled fund that helps realize a world where everyone has equal access to health services. It supports UN Member States and stakeholders to create the 40 million new health jobs needed by 2030 and avert the shortfall of health-workers, primarily in low- and lower-middle income countries.</narrative>
  </description>
